# City Competition — env templates live under apps/ (Expo + Fastify).
#
# Copy and edit:
#   cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
#   cp apps/client/.env.example apps/client/.env   # optional
#
# Required for API boot: DATABASE_URL + REDIS_URL
# Local Postgres/Redis (canonical):
#   cd apps/api && docker compose up -d
#   → postgres://city:city@127.0.0.1:5432/city_competition
#   → redis://127.0.0.1:6379
#
# The Fastify API loads apps/api/.env on boot (does not override already-exported vars).
# See apps/README.md for the full runbook.
